[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Drafts
Name[da]=Drafts
Name[de]=Drafts
Name[es]=Drafts
Name[fr]=Drafts
Name[pt_BR]=Drafts
Name[ar]=Drafts
Comment=Where text starts — capture, organize, and automate text
Comment[da]=Hvor tekst begynder — optag, organisér og automatisér tekst
Comment[de]=Wo Text beginnt — Text erfassen, organisieren und automatisieren
Comment[es]=Donde empieza el texto — captura, organiza y automatiza texto
Comment[fr]=Là où commence le texte — capturez, organisez et automatisez vos notes
Comment[pt_BR]=Onde o texto começa — capture, organize e automatize textos
Comment[ar]=حيث يبدأ النص — التقط ونظّم وأتمت النصوص
Exec=drafts %u
Icon=drafts
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;TextEditor;Office;
MimeType=x-scheme-handler/drafts;text/markdown;text/plain;
StartupWMClass=drafts
Actions=QuickCapture;

[Desktop Action QuickCapture]
Name=Quick Capture
Name[da]=Hurtig optagelse
Name[de]=Schnellerfassung
Name[es]=Captura rápida
Name[fr]=Capture rapide
Name[pt_BR]=Captura rápida
Name[ar]=التقاط سريع
Exec=drafts capture
